go-dmg-writer
Copyright 2026 go-dmg-writer authors

This product includes software developed as part of the go-dmg-writer project.

This is a clean-room implementation of the Apple HFSX filesystem and the
Apple UDIF (Universal Disk Image Format) container, written from public
specifications:

  - Apple Technical Note TN1150 ("HFS Plus Volume Format"),
    https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/technotes/tn/tn1150.html
  - Publicly documented UDIF / KOLY layout (Apple's `hdiutil` man page
    semantics and community reverse-engineering).
